flowchart TD
    subgraph ClientRequests ["Incoming API Requests"]
        ReqOTP["Request OTP / Reg"]
        ReqLock["Execute Financial Transfer"]
        ReqApi["Invoke API Endpoints"]
    end

    subgraph ServiceSubsystems ["Spring Service Layer"]
        OtpSvc["OtpCacheServiceImpl"]
        LockSvc["DistributedLockServiceImpl"]
        RateSvc["RateLimiterServiceImpl"]
    end

    subgraph RedisStore ["Redis 7 In-Memory Server"]
        OtpKeys[("Key: OTP:<phoneNumber>\nTTL: 5 Minutes (300s)")]
        LockKeys[("Key: LOCK:ACCOUNT:<id>\nTTL: 10s Lease (Redisson)")]
        RateKeys[("Key: RATELIMIT:<client>:<uri>\nTTL: 60s Window")]
    end

    ReqOTP --> OtpSvc
    OtpSvc -->|Save OTP with TTL| OtpKeys
    OtpSvc -->|Validate & Invalidate| OtpKeys

    ReqLock --> LockSvc
    LockSvc -->|SET NX PX (Acquire Mutex)| LockKeys
    LockSvc -->|DEL Key (Release Mutex)| LockKeys

    ReqApi --> RateSvc
    RateSvc -->|INCR Counter & EXPIRE| RateKeys
    RateKeys -->|Counter > Limit?| Throttled{Exceeded?}
    Throttled -- Yes --> Throw429[Throw RateLimitExceededException\nHTTP 429 Too Many Requests]
    Throttled -- No --> Proceed[Proceed Request Execution]
